#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:3
msgid "Language Pack Validation Policy"
msgstr "Valideringspolitik for sprogpakker"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:6
msgid "Submission guidelines"
msgstr "Retningslinjer for indsendelse"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:9
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beskrivelse"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:11
msgid ""
"Contribution description in the `Customisation Database`_ should be "
"translated into English in addition of your local language, as some "
"administrators might want to download your translation without speak your "
"language."
msgstr ""
"Beskrivelsen af bidraget i `Customisation Database`_ bør oversættes til "
"engelsk ud over dit lokale sprog, da nogle administratorer måske vil "
"downloade din oversættelse uden at tale dit sprog."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:17
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr "Skærmbillede"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:19
msgid ""
"Contribution screenshot in the `Customisation Database`_ should only be the "
"flag of the country whose the language is spoken. For example, the flag of "
"France for the French language."
msgstr ""
"Skærmbilledet til bidraget i `Customisation Database`_ bør kun være flaget "
"for det land, hvor sproget tales. For eksempel Frankrigs flag for det "
"franske sprog."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:24
msgid "Demo-Link"
msgstr "Demo-link"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:26
msgid ""
"The Demo URL in the Customisation Database must be empty, unless you want to"
" put a link to an international community (`officially`_ listed or not) "
"related to the language of the contribution. For example, "
"https://www.phpbb.nl/ as Demo URL concerning the `Dutch language`_ is "
"allowed."
msgstr ""
"Demo-URL'en i Customisation Database skal være tom, medmindre du ønsker at "
"angive et link til et internationalt fællesskab (`officially`_ opført eller "
"ej) relateret til bidragets sprog. For eksempel er https://www.phpbb.nl/ som"
" Demo-URL vedrørende `Dutch language`_ tilladt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:32
msgid "Package"
msgstr "Pakke"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:34
msgid ""
"The submitted ``<languagename>_<version>.zip`` must contain a "
"``<languagename>_<version>`` folder. The files from above should be placed "
"in this folder."
msgstr ""
"Den indsendte ``<languagename>_<version>.zip`` skal indeholde en mappe "
"``<languagename>_<version>``. Filerne ovenfor bør placeres i denne mappe."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:37
msgid ""
"Revision name in the `Customisation Database`_ should be left blank, contain"
" the phpBB package version and/or package release name (e.g. ``3.3.10`` / "
"``Bertie's translation` for 3.3.10) for more understanding."
msgstr ""
"Revisionsnavnet i `Customisation Database`_ bør lades tomt, indeholde phpBB-"
"pakkeversionen og/eller pakkeudgivelsesnavnet (f.eks. ``3.3.10`` / "
"``Bertie's translation`` for 3.3.10) for bedre forståelse."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:42
msgid "Package Validation"
msgstr "Validering af pakke"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:44
msgid ""
"Language packages must include all files that are included in the folders "
"for the English language. This includes the following folders:"
msgstr ""
"Sprogpakker skal inkludere alle filer, der er inkluderet i mapperne for det "
"engelske sprog. Dette omfatter følgende mapper:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:47
msgid "``ext/phpbb/viglink/language/en/``"
msgstr "``ext/phpbb/viglink/language/en/``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:48
msgid "``language/en/``"
msgstr "``language/en/``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:49
msgid "``styles/prosilver/theme/en/``"
msgstr "``styles/prosilver/theme/en/``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:51
msgid "Language packages must contain 1 additional files:"
msgstr "Sprogpakker skal indeholde 1 yderligere fil:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:53
msgid "``language/{iso}/LICENSE``"
msgstr "``language/{iso}/LICENSE``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:55
msgid "Language packages may contain 4 more additional files:"
msgstr "Sprogpakker kan indeholde 4 yderligere filer:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:57
msgid "``language/{iso}/AUTHORS.md``"
msgstr "``language/{iso}/AUTHORS.md``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:58
msgid "``language/{iso}/CHANGELOG.md``"
msgstr "``language/{iso}/CHANGELOG.md``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:59
msgid "``language/{iso}/README.md``"
msgstr "``language/{iso}/README.md``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:60
msgid "``language/{iso}/VERSION.md``"
msgstr "``language/{iso}/VERSION.md``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:62
msgid "No other additional files are allowed!"
msgstr "Ingen andre yderligere filer er tilladt!"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:63
msgid ""
"All folders within the language-directories must contain an ``index.htm`` "
"file (e.g. ``language/en/acp/index.htm``, ``language/en/index.htm``, "
"``styles/prosilver/theme/de/index.htm``, see the `Language Pack Submission "
"Policy`_ for a complete list.)."
msgstr ""
"Alle mapper i sprogmapperne skal indeholde en fil ``index.htm`` (f.eks. "
"``language/en/acp/index.htm``, ``language/en/index.htm``, "
"``styles/prosilver/theme/de/index.htm``, se `Language Pack Submission "
"Policy`_ for en komplet liste)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:64
msgid ""
"An exception from this rule are the the directories for the viglink-"
"translation and the directories which belong the phpBB package (e.g. "
"``language/``, ``styles/``)."
msgstr ""
"En undtagelse fra denne regel er mapperne til viglink-oversættelsen og de "
"mapper, der tilhører phpBB-pakken (f.eks. ``language/``, ``styles/``)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:67
msgid "File Validation"
msgstr "Validering af filer"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:69
msgid "All files must be stored using ``LF`` (LineFeed / UNIX) line endings."
msgstr ""
"Alle filer skal gemmes med linjeafslutninger af typen ``LF`` (LineFeed / "
"UNIX)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:70
msgid "All ``.php`` files must have a check for the ``IN_PHPBB`` constant:"
msgstr "Alle ``.php``-filer skal have en kontrol af konstanten ``IN_PHPBB``:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:79
msgid ""
"All files containing non-english language (``.php``, ``.txt``, as well as "
"all additional files from `Package Validation`_) must be saved as *UTF8 "
"without BOM*."
msgstr ""
"Alle filer, der indeholder ikke-engelsk sprog (``.php``, ``.txt``, samt alle"
" yderligere filer fra `Validering af pakke`_), skal gemmes som *UTF8 uden "
"BOM*."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:82
msgid ""
"``.php`` files must **not** produce any output. There should be no "
"characters before ``<?php``. ``.php`` files must **not** contain the closing"
" tag ``?>``, but just end with a new line"
msgstr ""
"``.php``-filer må **ikke** producere nogen output. Der bør ikke være tegn "
"før ``<?php``. ``.php``-filer må **ikke** indeholde den afsluttende tag "
"``?>``, men blot slutte med en ny linje"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:87
msgid "language/{iso}/iso.txt"
msgstr "language/{iso}/iso.txt"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:89
msgid "The file must contain exactly 3 lines:"
msgstr "Filen skal indeholde nøjagtigt 3 linjer:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:91
msgid "English language name"
msgstr "Engelsk sprognavn"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:92
msgid "Language name in the spoken language"
msgstr "Sprognavn på det talte sprog"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:93
msgid "Author(-group) information (Plaintext only, no links allowed)"
msgstr ""
"Oplysninger om forfatter(gruppe) (kun almindelig tekst, ingen links tilladt)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:96
msgid "\\*/index.htm"
msgstr "\\*/index.htm"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:98
msgid ""
"The ``index.htm`` files in all folders must either be completly empty, or "
"contains the default html body:"
msgstr ""
"Filerne ``index.htm`` i alle mapper skal enten være helt tomme eller "
"indeholde standard-HTML-brødteksten:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:115
msgid "language/{iso}/help/\\*.php"
msgstr "language/{iso}/help/\\*.php"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:117
msgid ""
"The file must must only contain 1 array named `$lang`. No other variables "
"are allowed."
msgstr ""
"Filen må kun indeholde 1 array ved navn `$lang`. Ingen andre variabler er "
"tilladt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:118
msgid "The array must only contain arrays with the following structure:"
msgstr "Arrayet må kun indeholde arrays med følgende struktur:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:127
msgid "If TextA is ``--`` the entry is a headline."
msgstr "Hvis TextA er ``--``, er posten en overskrift."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:128
msgid ""
"If both, TextA and TextB, are ``--`` the entry causes a column switch for "
"the 2 column page layout. A ``help/*.php`` file must contain exactly one of "
"these entries."
msgstr ""
"Hvis både TextA og TextB er ``--``, forårsager posten et kolonneskift for "
"det 2-kolonne sidelayout. En fil ``help/*.php`` skal indeholde nøjagtigt én "
"af disse poster."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:132
msgid "For TextA and TextB normal `Key Validation`_ applies."
msgstr "For TextA og TextB gælder den normale `Validering af nøgle`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:135
msgid "language/{iso}/email/\\*.txt and language/{iso}/email/short/\\*.txt"
msgstr "language/{iso}/email/\\*.txt and language/{iso}/email/short/\\*.txt"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:136
msgid ""
"Emails must only contain the subject-line, when the english email template "
"also contains it::"
msgstr ""
"E-mails må kun indeholde emnelinjen, når den engelske e-mailskabelon også "
"indeholder den::"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:141
msgid ""
"Emails must only contain the ``{EMAIL_SIG}``, when the english email "
"template also contains it. Additional the ``{EMAIL_SIG}`` must always be on "
"it's own line, must be the last line of text and is followed by an empty new"
" line."
msgstr ""
"E-mails må kun indeholde ``{EMAIL_SIG}``, når den engelske e-mailskabelon "
"også indeholder den. Derudover skal ``{EMAIL_SIG}`` altid stå på sin egen "
"linje, skal være den sidste tekstlinje og efterfølges af en tom ny linje."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:144
msgid ""
"Emails should use all variables that are provided in the english email "
"template, in order to provide the same information to the user."
msgstr ""
"E-mails bør bruge alle variabler, der leveres i den engelske e-mailskabelon,"
" for at give brugeren de samme oplysninger."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:146
msgid ""
"Emails may only contain ``{U_BOARD}``, ``{EMAIL_SIG}`` and ``{SITENAME}`` as"
" additional variables. No other variables are available."
msgstr ""
"E-mails må kun indeholde ``{U_BOARD}``, ``{EMAIL_SIG}`` og ``{SITENAME}`` "
"som yderligere variabler. Ingen andre variabler er tilgængelige."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:148
msgid "Emails must not use HTML content."
msgstr "E-mails må ikke bruge HTML-indhold."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:149
msgid "There must be an empty new line at the end of the file."
msgstr "Der skal være en tom ny linje i slutningen af filen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:152
msgid "language/{iso}/\\*.php and language/{iso}/acp/\\*.php"
msgstr "language/{iso}/\\*.php and language/{iso}/acp/\\*.php"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:153
msgid ""
"The file must must only contain 1 array named ``$lang``. No other variables "
"are allowed."
msgstr ""
"Filen må kun indeholde 1 array ved navn ``$lang``. Ingen andre variabler er "
"tilladt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:155
msgid ""
"Language files must contain all keys, which are included in the english "
"language file."
msgstr ""
"Sprogfiler skal indeholde alle nøgler, der er inkluderet i den engelske "
"sprogfil."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:157
msgid ""
"Language files must only contain keys, which are also included in the "
"english language file."
msgstr ""
"Sprogfiler må kun indeholde nøgler, der også er inkluderet i den engelske "
"sprogfil."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:159
msgid "For all entries the `Key Validation`_ applies."
msgstr "For alle poster gælder `Validering af nøgle`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:162
msgid "Key Validation"
msgstr "Validering af nøgle"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:165
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Type"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:167
msgid ""
"Entries must be of the same type as in the english language. If the entry is"
" of type ``string``, your translation must be of type ``string``. If the "
"english language is of type ``array`` (e.g. using plurals), your translation"
" must be of type ``array`` aswell."
msgstr ""
"Poster skal være af samme type som i det engelske sprog. Hvis posten er af "
"typen ``string``, skal din oversættelse være af typen ``string``. Hvis det "
"engelske sprog er af typen ``array`` (f.eks. ved brug af flertalsformer), "
"skal din oversættelse også være af typen ``array``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:171
msgid ""
"If the entry is an array, your translation must contain the same keys as the"
" english array. Exceptions are plural forms."
msgstr ""
"Hvis posten er et array, skal din oversættelse indeholde de samme nøgler som"
" det engelske array. Undtagelser er flertalsformer."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:175
msgid "String And Integer Replacements"
msgstr "Erstatninger af strenge og heltal"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:177
msgid ""
"If the english string contains replacements, such as ``%s``, ``%1$s``, "
"``%d`` and ``%1$d``, your string should contain the same number of "
"replacements. Exceptions are integer replacements in plural forms. This "
"allows you to use::"
msgstr ""
"Hvis den engelske streng indeholder erstatninger, såsom ``%s``, ``%1$s``, "
"``%d`` og ``%1$d``, bør din streng indeholde det samme antal erstatninger. "
"Undtagelser er heltalserstatninger i flertalsformer. Dette giver dig "
"mulighed for at bruge::"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:183
msgid "rather then::"
msgstr "i stedet for::"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:188
msgid "HTML"
msgstr "HTML"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:190
msgid ""
"Strings should only contain HTML that is also included in the english "
"strings."
msgstr ""
"Strenge bør kun indeholde HTML, der også er inkluderet i de engelske "
"strenge."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:192
msgid ""
"Additional ``<a href=\"\">``, ``<strong>``, ``<em>``, ``<u>`` and ``<br />``"
" are allowed."
msgstr ""
"Yderligere ``<a href=\"\">``, ``<strong>``, ``<em>``, ``<u>`` og ``<br />`` "
"er tilladt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:194
msgid "``<b>`` should not be used, use ``<strong>`` instead."
msgstr "``<b>`` bør ikke bruges, brug ``<strong>`` i stedet."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:195
msgid "``<i>`` should not be used, use ``<em>`` instead."
msgstr "``<i>`` bør ikke bruges, brug ``<em>`` i stedet."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:196
msgid ""
"Strings should only close HTML which it has opened itself and should close "
"all HTML it has opened. Exceptions here are:"
msgstr ""
"Strenge bør kun lukke HTML, som de selv har åbnet, og bør lukke al HTML, de "
"har åbnet. Undtagelser her er:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:199
msgid "``language/{iso}/install.php``"
msgstr "``language/{iso}/install.php``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:200
msgid "``INSTALL_INTRO_BODY``"
msgstr "``INSTALL_INTRO_BODY``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:201
msgid "``SUPPORT_BODY``"
msgstr "``SUPPORT_BODY``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:202
msgid "``UPDATE_INSTALLATION_EXPLAIN``"
msgstr "``UPDATE_INSTALLATION_EXPLAIN``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:203
msgid "``language/{iso}/ucp.php``"
msgstr "``language/{iso}/ucp.php``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:204
msgid "``TERMS_OF_USE_CONTENT``"
msgstr "``TERMS_OF_USE_CONTENT``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:205
msgid "``PRIVACY_POLICY``"
msgstr "``PRIVACY_POLICY``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:207
msgid ""
"which are always inside of a ``<p>`` tag and are allowed to close it, if "
"they reopen it later on."
msgstr ""
"som altid er inde i en ``<p>``-tag og har lov til at lukke den, hvis de "
"genåbner den senere."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:211
msgid "Arrays"
msgstr "Arrays"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:213
msgid ""
"Arrays must have the same structure and elements as the english version. "
"Exceptions are plural forms, which may have more or less keys, depending on "
"the plural rule."
msgstr ""
"Arrays skal have samme struktur og elementer som den engelske version. "
"Undtagelser er flertalsformer, som kan have flere eller færre nøgler, "
"afhængigt af flertalsreglen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:218
msgid "Copyright & License"
msgstr "Ophavsret og licens"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:221
msgid "Copyright"
msgstr "Ophavsret"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:223
msgid ""
"The translation is mostly your work and you have a right to hold a copyright"
" and names to it. Therefor a maximum of 3 links can be included as an author"
" credit in the footer, customisable via the ``TRANSLATION_INFO`` key in "
"``common.php``."
msgstr ""
"Oversættelsen er hovedsageligt dit eget arbejde, og du har ret til at have "
"ophavsret og navne til den. Derfor kan der medtages maksimalt 3 links som "
"forfatterkredit i sidefoden, som kan tilpasses via nøglen "
"``TRANSLATION_INFO`` i ``common.php``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:230
msgid ""
"The Translations Manager has complete discretion on what is acceptable as an"
" author credit link."
msgstr ""
"Translations Manager har fuld skønsbeføjelse over, hvad der er acceptabelt "
"som forfatterkreditlink."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:234
msgid "License"
msgstr "Licens"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:236
msgid ""
"All translations must be released under `GNU General Public License 2.0 "
"<http://www.opensource.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.php>`_"
msgstr ""
"Alle oversættelser skal udgives under `GNU General Public License 2.0 "
"<http://www.opensource.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.php>`_"
